{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#FF6B6B;--muted:#5D5F6A;--bg:#0F1226;--card:#0D1220;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071026 0%, #07182f 60%);color:#E6EEF6}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 32px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#FFB26B);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#122;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
    nav a{color:rgba(230,238,246,0.9);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}
    .hero{padding:48px 32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:26px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(3,8,20,0.6)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .profile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .bio{font-size:15px;color:#D9E6F6;line-height:1.6}
    .quick{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .chip{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;color:#EAF2FF}
    footer.small{font-size:13px;color:#B5C8DB;margin-top:10px}

    /* Story section */
    .story{padding:24px 32px 48px}
    .story-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:22px}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#CFE7FF;padding:18px;border-left:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}

    /* Framework */
    .framework{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .step{background:var(--glass-2);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .step h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}

    /* CTA */
    .cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#122;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
    .btn.alt{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:#EAF2FF}

    /* small print */
    .legal{font-size:13px;color:#9FB1C8;line-height:1.5;margin-top:16px}

    /* pattern accent */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:8px;top:120px;opacity:0.08;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:12px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:cover;filter:blur(0.8px)}

    @media (max-width:900px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin:18px}
      .story-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .pattern{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">PP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="about.html">About the Work</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">My Way</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
      <a href="book.html" style="margin-left:20px;font-weight:800">Book</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="panel">
        <h1>About the practice</h1>
        <p class="lead">I offer clear, humane psychotherapy for adults navigating life transitions, relationships, and the recurring patterns that make things feel stalled. Sessions blend clinical grounding with practical steps you can use between meetings.</p>

        <section class="profile" aria-labelledby="profile-heading">
          <div class="bio">
            I work with people who want steady, individualized support — not a rush to fix, but a careful map toward clearer decisions and gentler rhythms. My training is in evidence-informed therapies and relational practice; I aim to be straightforward, curious, and reflective in sessions.
          </div>

          <div class="quick" aria-hidden="false">
            <div class="chip">Adults • 18+</div>
            <div class="chip">Virtual + In-person</div>
            <div class="chip">Short-term & ongoing</div>
          </div>

          <div class="cta" style="margin-top:12px">
            <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn alt" href="contact.html">Ask a question — email</a>
          </div>

          <div class="legal">
            Confidentiality: sessions are confidential within legal and ethical limits. I will discuss boundaries, limits, and how records are kept during our first visit. This practice does not provide emergency services; if you are in crisis, call local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel">
        <h3 id="profile-heading">Quick snapshot</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">A steady, practical approach for people who want to name patterns, craft experiments in daily life, and feel more agency in relationships.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:16px">
          <strong>Phone</strong>
          <div class="small" style="color:#CDE7FF;margin-top:6px">{{PHONE}}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px">
          <strong>Email</strong>
          <div class="small" style="color:#CDE7FF;margin-top:6px">{{EMAIL}}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px">
          <strong>Typical first session</strong>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We clarify your priorities, review history, and set an initial focus that feels manageable. You decide the pace from there.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <div class="story">
      <div class="story-grid">
        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Why a small, steady practice</h3>
          <p class="bio">Therapy is most useful when it fits your life. I design short, focused pathways and longer partnerships depending on what you need. We test ideas, observe what changes, and keep what helps. The work is collaborative: I bring structure and training; you bring lived experience and goals.</p>

          <div class="framework" role="list">
            <div class="step" role="listitem">
              <h4>Notice</h4>
              <div style="color:var(--muted)">We name patterns and moments that recur.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step" role="listitem">
              <h4>Try</h4>
              <div style="color:var(--muted)">We design small experiments you can test between sessions.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step" role="listitem">
              <h4>Reflect</h4>
              <div style="color:var(--muted)">We explore what worked, what felt hard, and revise the plan.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="panel">
          <h4>Confidentiality + limits</h4>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">Conversations are private to the extent permitted by law. Exceptions include imminent risk of harm to self or others, suspected abuse of a minor or vulnerable person, or court orders. If you have concerns about privacy, we will discuss them before beginning care.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px" class="panel">
        <h4>Words from people I've worked with</h4>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)">"Calm, direct, and practical — the sessions helped me make choices I could actually keep." — a client</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:0 32px 60px">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Next step</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted)">If you want to talk about fit, a brief consult call helps us both decide how to proceed. I’ll listen for what feels most urgent and suggest a short path forward.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Start with a brief consult</a></div>

        <div class="legal">Note: therapy is a professional relationship and not a substitute for emergency or medical care. If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services or a crisis line in your area.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</body>
</html>"} 
