<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Focus Areas — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#071026;--card:#081426;--accent:#6BE3FF;--warm:#FF9F6B;--muted:#AFC7DB}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#061029 0%,#07172b 70%);color:#EAF6FF}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 28px}
    .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
    .logo .mark{width:42px;height:42;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--warm),#FF6BB3);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;color:#081422}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:#DFF6FF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}

    main{padding:18px 28px}
    .lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:760px}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .left{display:grid;gap:18px}

    /* Tracks / Focus cards */
    .track{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
    .track h3{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .track p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
    .toggle{display:flex;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px;width:max-content;gap:6px}
    .toggle button{border:0;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#9bffea);color:#032333}
    .price-grid{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .price-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;flex:1}
    .price-amount{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#EAF6FF}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}
    .mood{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:var(--muted)}
    .mood.sel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0B1B2A,rgba(255,255,255,0.01));color:var(--accent);border-color:rgba(107,227,255,0.12)}
    .method-panel{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),transparent);transition:all 320ms ease}

    .cta{margin-top:14px}
    .btn{background:var(--warm);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#081422;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}

    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}

    @media (max-width:920px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.left{order:2}.right{order:1}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo"><div class="mark">PP</div><div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1 style="margin:6px 0 2px 0">Focus and offerings</h1>
    <div class="lead">Practical pathways for recurring difficulties: relationship patterns, anxiety that gets in the way of plans, transitions that feel overwhelming, and the slow-burning fatigue of life demands.</div>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="left">
        <section class="track">
          <h3>Relationship patterns</h3>
          <p class="lead">Explore how past experiences shape present interactions. We identify interaction cycles and try small experiments that change how you connect.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="track">
          <h3>Transition & change</h3>
          <p class="lead">Decisions, career moves, endings — we break choices into manageable steps and build clarity without rushing the process.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="track">
          <h3>Persistent worry & pacing</h3>
          <p class="lead">Tools to reduce rumination and create practical routines that support attention, sleep, and calm.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="track">
          <h3>Complicated grief & life stops</h3>
          <p class="lead">Longer, patient work that honors loss while finding ways to reconnect with daily purpose.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="pricing" aria-hidden="false" style="margin-top:10px">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <strong>Rates</strong>
            <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing mode">
              <button id="mode-monthly" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
              <button id="mode-package" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Package</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="price-grid" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="price-card">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Short Series</div>
              <div class="price-amount" data-month="140" data-package="540">$140</div>
              <div class="sub">60-minute session / 4-session package</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Focused Block</div>
              <div class="price-amount" data-month="155" data-package="600">$155</div>
              <div class="sub">60-minute session / 6-session package</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Ongoing care</div>
              <div class="price-amount" data-month="170" data-package="990">$170</div>
              <div class="sub">Typical weekly or biweekly work</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="note">Prices shown as single-session rates or bundled package totals. Packages provide a modest per-session reduction and structured time to test changes. Payment, cancellations, and sliding considerations are discussed at intake. This practice does not provide emergency services.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="right">
        <div class="panel" style="background:transparent;padding:0">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:8px">Mood-to-Method</h3>
          <div class="moods" role="list" aria-label="Choose current state">
            <button class="mood sel" data-key="stuck">Stuck</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="curious">Curious</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="grieving">Grieving</button>
          </div>

          <div class="method-panel" id="methodPanel">
            <h4 id="methodTitle">When you feel stuck</h4>
            <p id="methodDesc" style="color:var(--muted)">We map recurring moments and set small experiments to shift interaction patterns and decision points. A short series often produces clear next steps.</p>
            <div class="cta"><a id="methodCta" class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Book a focused series</a></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Select the state that fits best and the suggestion will adapt. These are not guarantees but practical starting points.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator: animate between monthly and package
    (function(){
      const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('mode-monthly');
      const packageBtn = document.getElementById('mode-package');
      let mode = 'month';
      const amounts = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.price-amount'));

      function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function tick(now){
          const t = Math.min(1, (now - startTime)/duration);
          const value = Math.round(start + (end - start) * (t<0.5? (2*t*t) : (-1 + (4-2*t)*t ))); // ease-ish
          el.textContent = '$' + value;
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }

      function setMode(to){
        if(to === 'month'){
          monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); packageBtn.classList.remove('active');
          monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
          amounts.forEach(a=> animateValue(a, parseInt(a.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')), parseInt(a.dataset.month), 420));
          mode='month';
        } else {
          packageBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active');
          packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
          amounts.forEach(a=> animateValue(a, parseInt(a.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')), parseInt(a.dataset.package), 420));
          mode='package';
        }
      }

      monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>setMode('month'));
      packageBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>setMode('package'));
    })();

    // Mood-to-Method selector: updates method panel
    (function(){
      const map = {
        stuck: {title:'When you feel stuck', desc:'We map repeating moments, then try small experiments. A 4–6 session block often creates clarity to choose next steps.', cta:'Book a focused series'},
        overwhelmed: {title:'When things feel overwhelming', desc:'We prioritize what helps you reduce urgent friction and build pacing tools so decisions are less consuming.', cta:'Start a pacing consult'},
        curious: {title:'If you are exploring', desc:'Short, targeted work helps you try ideas and see what fits. We set experiments and review quickly.', cta:'Try a short consult'},
        grieving: {title:'When loss slows you down', desc:'Longer, compassionate support that respects pace and finds steady ways to re-engage with daily life.', cta:'Discuss longer support'}
      };

      const moods = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
      const title = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
      const desc = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
      const cta = document.getElementById('methodCta');

      moods.forEach(btn=> btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        moods.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('sel'));
        btn.classList.add('sel');
        const k = btn.dataset.key;
        const pick = map[k];
        // morph animation: fade, update, fade in
        document.getElementById('methodPanel').style.opacity=0.3;
        setTimeout(()=>{
          title.textContent=pick.title;
          desc.textContent=pick.desc;
          cta.textContent=pick.cta;
          // set a simple query param so booking reflects mood
          cta.setAttribute('href','{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood='+encodeURIComponent(k));
          document.getElementById('methodPanel').style.opacity=1;
        },180);
      }));
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#081226;--card:#0C1630;--accent:#C7FFBD;--muted:#9FB7C9}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#051224 0%,#071622 80%);color:#E8F8FF;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 22px}
    nav a{color:#DFF6FF;text-decoration:none;margin-left:12px}

    main{padding:22px}
    .hero{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .hero .left{flex:1}
    .badge{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#81FFD1,#6BE3FF);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:#022;font-weight:800}
    h1{margin:6px 0}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:760px}

    .model{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;flex:1}
    .card h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}

    .mood-wrap{margin-top:18px}
    .mood-row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .mood-btn{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .mood-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#062433,rgba(255,255,255,0.01));color:var(--accent);border-color:rgba(199,255,189,0.16)}

    .method{margin-top:12px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.012),transparent);transition:300ms ease}
    .method h3{margin:0}
    .method p{color:var(--muted)}

    .cta{margin-top:14px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#021;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}

    .legal{font-size:13px;color:#ADC6DA;margin-top:14px}

    @media (max-width:860px){.model{flex-direction:column}.hero{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="left">
        <div class="badge">Clinical + Practical</div>
        <h1>How I work with people</h1>
        <p class="lead">The practice combines empathic listening, hypothesis-driven experiments, and practical tools you can use between sessions. We name patterns, try small changes, and track what moves you forward.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="width:260px" class="card">
        <strong>Typical rhythm</strong>
        <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Initial intake clarifies goals. Short blocks (4–8 sessions) test changes. Ongoing care available for sustained work.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="model">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Relational focus</h4>
        <p class="lead">We look at repeated interaction patterns and try small experiments that change the shape of conversations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Behavioral experiments</h4>
        <p class="lead">Short, practical tasks designed to reveal what helps and what hinders — then we revise the plan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Reflective stance</h4>
        <p class="lead">We track changes and make adjustments based on what you notice and report back between sessions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mood-wrap">
      <strong>Choose how you feel — see a suggested method</strong>
      <div class="mood-row" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector">
        <button class="mood-btn active" data-key="tired">Tired</button>
        <button class="mood-btn" data-key="stressed">Stressed</button>
        <button class="mood-btn" data-key="curious">Curious</button>
        <button class="mood-btn" data-key="sore">Sore</button>
      </div>

      <div class="method" id="method">
        <h3 id="methodHead">If you're feeling tired</h3>
        <p id="methodBody" style="color:var(--muted)">We focus on small pacing changes, sleep-friendly habits, and reducing decision friction so energy is less taxed. A short consult clarifies priorities and a 4-session block tests practical steps.</p>
        <div class="cta"><a id="methodButton" class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Book a pacing consult</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:18px" class="legal">
